9. Determinism Guarantees

This system is fully deterministic because:
	•	Supply is hard-capped
	•	Start block is set once (at inscription #1000)
	•	Emissions depend only on block height
	•	Weights depend only on tokenId
	•	Ownership is read directly from the NFT
	•	No admin variables can be changed post-deploy

Inscription Count Independence

Whether the system ends with:
	•	10,000 inscriptions
	•	100,000 inscriptions
	•	10,000,000 inscriptions

➡ Total emissions are identical.
Only distribution per inscription changes.

